# ── Commerce OS root .dockerignore ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Applies to every image build (all Dockerfiles use the repo root as the
# build context). Keep this list conservative: the builders only need the
# workspace manifests, sources, and prisma schema/migrations.

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the builder stage)
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Build outputs (rebuilt inside the builder stage)
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/.turbo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Environment files & secrets — never bake them into images.
# The example stays available for reference inside builds.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Version control
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Repo docs & reference material (not needed inside images)
docs
_reference
README_FA.md

# Local tooling / editor / OS noise
.mimosa
scripts
start-dev.bat
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
